<urn:atm:triage:finding/AW1-RBP-F003>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AW1-RBP-F003" ;
  triage:title "observability_guidance() maps five observability error codes to one generic remediation string" ;
  triage:description "rust-best-practices-agent RBP-F003 (confirmed by quality-mgr 01M1QGNECH4XPMY4KR9VHD7SXY): crates/atm-storage/src/error_catalog.rs:219-230 fn observability_guidance() maps all five ObservabilityEmitFailed/QueryFailed/FollowFailed/HealthFailed/BootstrapFailed codes (crates/atm-error/src/error_codes.rs:116-120) to the single string 'Repair the observability backend or retry the operation later.' Fix: differentiate the arms (bootstrap -> filesystem/permissions guidance; emit/health -> retry or report poisoned lock; query/follow -> log path/permissions). Call sites in the AW.1 diff: crates/atm-daemon-bootstrap/src/daemon_observability.rs 96-108, 172-194, 200-208, 328-341; pre-existing constructors crates/atm-storage/src/error.rs:495-525." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-aw" ;
